      "content": "That's a good start for the module. To ensure the students see a diverse range of patient profiles, can you create a second, similar case study? \n\nThe clinical presentation should be the same—a 45-year-old with a suspected femoral fracture from a fall—but please use a different demographic profile for the patient (e.g., a Black or Hispanic male) to help students practice with different patient interactions. Keep the vital signs and the injury severity the same, but vary the name and background.",
